      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "Robert Ashworth from Bellingham, WA., USA",
      "description": "JC Penny's downtown location before Bellis Fair Mall. Also there was a Woolworths and a Bonanza 88 Cent store. In the next block where Rite Aid is today (2021) was Pay N Save. The same kind of store.\nTook this picture for a friend of mine's banner over Cornwall Avenue. Rebecca's Showcase Concert that was to be at WWU. \n\nAlso notice old florescent tube streetlights.",
